{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine provides two ways to install Ada Script plugins:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Automatic discovery","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" embeds every ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file in an executable target at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"build time and generates one plugin backed by one target-level script module.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Manual loading","type":"text"}]},{"text":" creates an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" from source text or a file URL at runtime."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEditor-created projects use automatic discovery. Use manual loading when scripts live outside the Swift target, come from a downloaded package, or need explicit error handling."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Create a script","anchor":"Create-a-script"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Movement.ada"},{"type":"text","text":" anywhere below the executable target’s source directory, for example:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Sources\/MyGame\/","├── main.swift","└── Scripts\/","    └── Movement.ada"],"syntax":"text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare a system and its query with annotations:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform)","    var transforms;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in transforms) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            position[0] += 100 * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine discovers "},{"code":"@system","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"@query","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" metadata and calls "},{"code":"update(context)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever the selected scheduler runs."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Enable automatic discovery","anchor":"Enable-automatic-discovery"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Expose ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to your executable target in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ swift-tools-version: 6.2","import PackageDescription","","let package = Package(","    name: \"MyGame\",","    platforms: [","        .macOS(.v15)","    ],","    dependencies: [","        .package(","            url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/AdaEngine\/AdaEngine.git\",","            branch: \"main\"","        )","    ],","    targets: [","        .executableTarget(","            name: \"MyGame\",","            dependencies: [","                .product(name: \"AdaEngine\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ],","            plugins: [","                .plugin(name: \"AdaScriptBuildPlugin\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ]","        )","    ]",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose a version requirement appropriate for your project instead of a branch dependency when consuming a released AdaEngine version."}]}],"style":"important","name":"Important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The build plugin finds ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files through SwiftPM, sorts them by target-relative","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path, and generates ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptPluginsGenerated.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the plugin work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory. The generated plugin passes one source map to one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":". Script source is embedded in the executable; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"original files are not read at runtime.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the generated plugin in your app scene:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(AdaScriptPluginsGenerated())","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rebuilding the target after adding, removing, renaming, or editing an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file refreshes the generated source."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In a portable AdaScript project running in AdaEditor’s macOS game window, edits","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files hot reload after a short pause, including unsaved editor buffers.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The current ECS world remains active. A failed candidate leaves the last valid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code running and reports the error in Output. System instances and ordinary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"script globals restart, and startup systems run once for the new version;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exported scriptable-object fields survive. Changes to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component, resource, network, or scriptable-object schemas require restarting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the game.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The same generated source contains native backing structs and registration for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scalar "},{"code":"@component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"@resource","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" declarations. Because these declarations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change Swift layout, adding or editing their stored fields requires rebuilding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the target rather than source-only reload."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Register-custom-components","level":2,"text":"Register custom components","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ada Script resolves component names while plugins are set up. Register custom Swift components before the generated script plugin:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","@Component","struct Movement: Codable, Sendable {","    var velocity: Vector2","}","","struct GameComponentsPlugin: Plugin {","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        Movement.registerComponent()","    }","}","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(","            GameComponentsPlugin(),","            AdaScriptPluginsGenerated()","        )","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" macro supplies field reflection for supported property types. A plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Component"},{"type":"text","text":" can participate in query matching, but its fields are not automatically available through the script bridge."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Load-a-script-manually","level":2,"text":"Load a script manually","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when you need control over the source location or loading failure:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","struct RuntimeScriptsPlugin: Plugin {","    let scriptURL: URL","","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        do {","            let script = try AdaScriptPlugin(contentsOf: scriptURL)","            app.addPlugin(script)","        } catch {","            print(\"Could not load Ada Script: \\(error)\")","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when one source is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already in memory, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptPlugin\/init(sources:name:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values for a multi-file module. Script compilation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"import resolution, and annotation validation happen during initialization.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Native component resolution happens later during plugin setup."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Next-steps","text":"Next steps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for annotation syntax, then "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for queries, component fields, and native iterator behavior."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript"]}],"references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin/init(source:name:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"convenience"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"prec